			"updated": 1784563368549,
			"locked": false,
			"text": "Routing Cases:\n\n1. A -> D : Subnet -> ARP Request -> Store to ARP table -> Create Frame -> Forwarded to D via Switch\n2. C -> X : Subnet -> ARP Request for Default Gateway -> Store to ARP Table -> Create Frame with X's Ip and DG MAC -> Forward to default Gateway\n    ",
			"rawText": "Routing Cases:\n\n1. A -> D : Subnet -> ARP Request -> Store to ARP table -> Create Frame -> Forwarded to D via Switch\n2. C -> X : Subnet -> ARP Request for Default Gateway -> Store to ARP Table -> Create Frame with X's Ip and DG MAC -> Forward to default Gateway\n    ",
			"fontSize": 20,
